{"format_version":"vbulletin-3+-thread","url":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1340077-dragon-blooded-companion-heirs-to-the-shogunate-pdf","id":1340077,"title":"Dragon-Blooded Companion: Heirs to the Shogunate PDF","path":["Home","Onyx Path","White Wolf Worlds","Exalted","Dragon-Blooded"],"posts":[{"date":"2019-10-07T13:51:28-07:00","id":1340077,"title":"Dragon-Blooded Companion: Heirs to the Shogunate PDF","content":"I was wondering about this from the kickstarter. Any word on it?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/10745-nosleeves","name":"nosleeves","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Jan 2016"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"73"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T14:05:13-07:00","id":1340078,"title":"","content":"I get my Kickstarter news from Kickstarter.<br /> <br /> <a href=\"https://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/deluxe-exalted-3rd-edition/posts/2635449\" target=\"_blank\">https://www.kickstarter.com/projects.../posts/2635449</a><br /> <br /> It's still in development. So... third quarter of 2021 maybe.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/899114-the-official-exalted-forum-introduction-thread?p=899399#post899399\" target=\"_blank\">Hi, I'm JohnDoe244</a>. My posts represent my opinions, not facts.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/531-johndoe244","name":"JohnDoe244","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar531_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2958"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T14:20:47-07:00","id":1340080,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>nosleeves</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1340077-dragon-blooded-companion-heirs-to-the-shogunate-pdf#post1340077\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was wondering about this from the kickstarter. Any word on it?</div> </div> </div> </div>Currently in delopment. This means drafts are complete, and the devs are going through, mkaing sure stuff is uniform, and also putting in art notes before it moves on to the next stage of things, which is final edits, art and layout (ie, putting it all together). Probably not gonna be done before the end of the year. 2021 is a bit overly pessamstic.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T14:39:08-07:00","id":1340086,"title":"","content":"I saw this thread and thought it was out. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> Never mind.<br /> <br /> My guess is it'll be the next book released after Lunars, so probably middle of 2020.<br /> <br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>JohnDoe244</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">It's still in development. So... third quarter of 2021 maybe.</div> </div> </div> </div>Nah, Holden and Hatewheel aren't the devs anymore.<br /> <br /> <br /> Although... anyone remember what the next book scheduled is (not Kickstarter, actual book)? I think it's Lunars then Heirs to the Shogunate. Or maybe it's Lunars then Across the Eight Directions.<br /> <br /> I'll be honest, I don't mind if Heirs is after other new books, because Heirs will revive interest in playing Dragonblood, so it makes sense for it to come out when people are a bit bored of Dragonblood (like 2e's Thousand Correct Actions), and have other stuff first (so... I guess Across the Eight Directions, maybe... Chronicles of Legend? The ST Guide. I can't remember the name off-hand)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T15:30:40-07:00","id":1340100,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1340077-dragon-blooded-companion-heirs-to-the-shogunate-pdf?p=1340086#post1340086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Nah, Holden and Hatewheel aren't the devs anymore.</div> </div> </div> </div>As often as this joke comes up and not the thread for it, I do wanna note the corebook was in layout for over a year, and also that it's not unique for OPP books to take a bit. SO anything can happen, not just the devs having life issues.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1340077-dragon-blooded-companion-heirs-to-the-shogunate-pdf?p=1340086#post1340086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">Although... anyone remember what the next book scheduled is (not Kickstarter, actual book)? I think it's Lunars then Heirs to the Shogunate. Or maybe it's Lunars then Across the Eight Directions.<br /> <br /> I'll be honest, I don't mind if Heirs is after other new books, because Heirs will revive interest in playing Dragonblood, so it makes sense for it to come out when people are a bit bored of Dragonblood (like 2e's Thousand Correct Actions), and have other stuff first (so... I guess Across the Eight Directions, maybe... Chronicles of Legend? The ST Guide. I can't remember the name off-hand)</div> </div> </div> </div>We hve <i>Hundred Devils Night Parade</i> and <i>Adversaries of the Righteous</i> in part to keep us with soemthing to look forward to reguarly for the time being. I keep track of Monday Meetings and post regularly on various sites as it comes up what's the status of things about when it chagnges.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <b>First Draft</b><br /> Exigents: Out of the Ashes<br /> Many-Faced Strangers<br /> Exalted Essay Collection<br /> <br /> <b>Redlines</b><br /> Crucible of Legends<br /> Dragon-Blooded Novella #2<br /> <br /> <b>Second Draft</b><br /> Across the Eight Directions<br /> <br /> <b>Development</b><br /> Heirs to the Shogunate<br /> Dragon-Blooded Novella #1<br /> Lunar Novella #1<br /> <br /> <b>Editing</b><br /> Lunars: Fangs at the Gate<br /> <br /> <b>Art Direction</b><br /> Lunars: Fangs at the Gate<br /> Monthly material<br /> <br /> <b>Confirmed, Status Unknown</b><br /> Adversaries of the Righteous Compilation<br /> Hundred Devils Night Parade Compilation </div> </div> </div>Based on things, I kind of expect HDNP or Lunars before anything else since they are furthest along (ie, in art and editting).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>And stuff.<br /> <sub><a href=\"https://blaqueandstuff.deviantart.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My DeviantArt Page</a> // <a href=\"http://blaqueandstuff.tumblr.com/\" target=\"_blank\">My tumblr</a> // <a href=\"http://www.dropbox.com/sh/trxegr5hl27s1l5/AAAegBBzxbDhvk1YpYJqdhz8a?dl=0\" target=\"_blank\">Exalted 3e Houserules</a></sub>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/353-blaque","name":"Blaque","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar353_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2976"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T15:56:24-07:00","id":1340104,"title":"","content":"Yeah, looking at that I imagine you're right. But it's very difficult to tell with HDNP. Anyway, it looks to me from that it'll be mid-2020.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>&quot;Blaque</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I do wanna note the corebook was in layout for over a year</div> </div> </div> </div>True, but it was way, way bigger than most books, and each chapter had it's own individual background and complicated stuff like that. I guess you never know, but I don't expect that to happen again.<br /> <br />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>STing Bronze Age Exalted","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2402-the-wizard-of-oz","name":"The Wizard of Oz","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2402_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Feb 2014"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"10350"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2019-10-07T16:02:59-07:00","id":1340106,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>The Wizard of Oz</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/exalted/dragon-blooded/1340077-dragon-blooded-companion-heirs-to-the-shogunate-pdf?p=1340086#post1340086\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I saw this thread and thought it was out. <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/frown.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Frown\" smilieid=\"11\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>I feel you.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1121-drlovemonkey","name":"DrLoveMonkey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1121_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"4736"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}